      <p begin="00:10.970" end="00:12.470" ttm:agent="v1">All the commas</p>
      <p begin="00:12.030" end="00:14.120" ttm:agent="v1">Murda on the beat so it's not nice</p>
      <p begin="00:14.120" end="00:16.360" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, hmm</p>
      <p begin="00:16.360" end="00:19.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">For this life I cannot change (change)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.050" end="00:21.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hidden Hills, deep off in the main (main)</p>
      <p begin="00:21.990" end="00:25.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">M&amp;M's, sweet like candy cane (cane)</p>
